/*
 * The paper-card surface: IBM Plex embedded as base64 so the page makes no
 * network request, a ruled-paper canvas behind the shell, and one card grid
 * for every figure. No client framework, no cookies, no forms other than the
 * lookup box. Styles and the scene script are hashed into the CSP.
 */
